_out/
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# Local engram state stays out, but the project declaration is repo config:
# it is what routes the motor's memory, so it must travel with the repo.
.engram/*
!.engram/config.json

# CC0 downloads are OUT (Joan, 2026-09-01): the motor generates its own
# textures. mat_textured() degrades to flat colour when a file is absent, so
# an empty _textures/ is a supported state, not a broken one.
_textures/
